    "answer": {
      "short": "$5$ cm per week.",
      "worked": "Using the labelled points $(0,10)$ and $(4,30)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Rise} &= 30-10=20\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Run} &= 4-0=4\\text{ weeks}\\\\m &= \\frac{\\text{rise}}{\\text{run}}\\\\m &= \\frac{20}{4}=5\\text{ cm per week}.\\end{align*}$$",
